# libcss: SVG stroke and stroke-width properties (patch 358, with 358-netsurf)
# Generated 2026-10-30
# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 357)
#
# libcss had no `stroke` or `stroke-width`, so CSS strokes on inline SVG
# (outline icon kits with `stroke: currentColor` on the <svg>, class rules
# on paths) were dropped at parse time.
#
#  - CSS_PROP_STROKE (0x0ac): none | currentColor | <color>, inherited,
