#    <number> stored as px (SVG user units; css__parse_unit_specifier
#    refuses unitless numbers outside quirks). Inherited, initial 1px.
#    Read with css_computed_stroke_width(); relative units resolve against
#    the element's style when drawn.
#  - Wiring, as for isolation (332): property enum, opcodes, important.c
#    operand counts, property strings, the parse and dispatch tables, the
#    Makefiles, p_stroke.c / p_stroke_width.c / s_stroke.c /
#    s_stroke_width.c.
